{
    "bundles": {
        "Musikhood\\AuthClient\\AuthClientBundle": ["all"]
    },
    "copy-from-recipe": {
        "config/": "%CONFIG_DIR%/"
    },
    "env": {
        "#1": "Auth server URL and panel credentials from the access base (secret_to_env) -> .env.local / k8s secret. Never commit the secret.",
        "AUTH_BASE_URL": "",
        "AUTH_PANEL_ID": "",
        "AUTH_CLIENT_ID": "",
        "AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET": ""
    },
    "post-install-output": [
        "",
        "<bg=blue;fg=white>                                                       </>",
        "<bg=blue;fg=white>  auth-client-bundle zainstalowany — jeszcze 3 kroki:  </>",
        "<bg=blue;fg=white>                                                       </>",
        "",
        "  <fg=cyan>1.</> Uzupelnij <comment>AUTH_BASE_URL</>, <comment>AUTH_PANEL_ID</>, <comment>AUTH_CLIENT_ID</>, <comment>AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET</>",
        "     w <comment>.env.local</> (adres auth servera i dane panelu z bazy dostepow: secret_to_env).",
        "",
        "  <fg=cyan>2.</> <comment>bin/console auth-client:install</>",
        "     (security.yaml, CORS, trusted proxies — pokaze zmiany przed zapisem).",
        "",
        "  <fg=cyan>3.</> <comment>bin/console auth-client:doctor</>   (ma byc zielono)",
        "",
        "  Encja User / tabela NIE sa potrzebne (tryb bezstanowy). Polityka 2FA — tylko w panelu administracyjnym auth servera.",
        "  Instrukcja: <href=https://github.com/musikhood/auth-client-bundle/blob/main/INTEGRATION.md>INTEGRATION.md</> (agent AI: vendor/musikhood/auth-client-bundle/AI_INTEGRATION.md)",
        ""
    ]
}
